# Build output (object files, libsynth.a copies, and the linked binary) is
# reproducible from source via `nice make -j2 all` and must never be
# tracked — this repo already carries real pain from tracked build
# artifacts under src/FroggersTiga/build/ (see tasks.md 12.4); do not repeat
